This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
re-expresses Microsoft's C# coding conventions as a grounded IDD graph so consuming
projects can compose it with throughline.

Microsoft's C# coding conventions are published by Microsoft as part of the Microsoft
Learn documentation under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
License. The rule text re-expressed here in items' `text`/`attrs.source_ref` is derived
from that documentation and remains the work of Microsoft and its contributors; this
repository claims no ownership over that content and reproduces it for interoperability.
See https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/csharp/fundamentals/coding-style/coding-conventions
for the authoritative source.
